          "audioFile": "kelvin_match_start_haze_kelvin_convo02_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/kelvin_match_start_haze_kelvin_convo02_04.mp3",
          "text": "I take it I should make myself\u2026 unavailable after the ritual?",
